\cb3 One last note (to keep \'93instrument-only\'94)\cb1 \
\cb3 Do not claim \'93BOSS proves \uc0\u964 =41.9\'94 in the code or UI.\cb1 \
\
\cb3 Just compute and publish: \'93Given dataset X, mapping Y, the best \uc0\u964  was Z under RIS gating.\'94\cb1 \
\cb3 That\'92s how we keep it sovereign.\cb1 \
\cb3 If you want, paste the current Anamnesis kernel units (it\'92s currently dt_s/tau_s in seconds). I\'92ll confirm the clean default resampling step (dt_myr) and tau candidate grid spacing so it\'92s stable on real, sparse f\uc0\u963 8 points.\cb1 \

