\f0\b0 \AppleTypeServices\AppleTypeServicesF65539 \cf2 \cb4 The stall happens because the "Landscape" of the search is too flat\'97there are too many ways to fit a smooth curve, so the solver doesn't know which way to move the gradient.\cb1 \
