\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 High Gradient Contrast:
\f0\b0 \AppleTypeServices\AppleTypeServicesF65539 \'a0Because the shapes are so distinct (e.g., a "V" looks nothing like a "Level"), the mathematical "slope" becomes very steep. The solver "falls" into the correct solution almost instantly.\cb1 \
