\cb3 ### 5. Null Model (Anti-Numerology Gate)\cb1 \
\
\cb3 For each trial:\cb1 \
\cb3 - Generate uniform random pseudo-gamma values (same range as observed)\cb1 \
\cb3 - Test same mapping families\cb1 \
\cb3 - Record best relative error\cb1 \
\
\cb3 Compute p_value = fraction(null_best_err \uc0\u8804  observed_best_err)\cb1 \
\
\cb3 **Interpretation:** If p_value \uc0\u8804  0.05, the observed match is unlikely by chance.\cb1 \
